# Kebu Property Infrastructure

Full spec: `docs/product/KEBU-PROPERTY-INFRASTRUCTURE.md`

**NOT STARTED** until explicitly assigned. Do not build listing UI, fake verify badges, or property nav in Phase One without assignment.

## Framing

**Not** a property website or “African Mubawab.” **Infrastructure underneath African property transactions.**

**Trust is the product:** Property Passport (e.g. `SN-SAL-004821`) with honest **N/M checks completed** — never “Verified” when incomplete.

## Core systems (future — slice order in spec)

Scam Shield (proactive fraud) · Payment orchestration (cash + Wave/Orange/cards — one ledger) · Diaspora mode · Professionals network + transparent Trust Scores · BUILD HERE + construction escrow/milestones · Property OS · Short-stay · Use-case search (“land near…”) · Intelligence with Verified/Estimate/AI labels · **Africa Lens** country modules · Admin OS

## V1 (Senegal first when assigned)

DISCOVER · VERIFY (Passport) · CONNECT · SAVE · MESSAGE — only. Not V2–V6 until V1 is TESTED.

## Domains

PROPERTY CORE · MARKETPLACE · TRANSACTIONS · BUILD · OPERATIONS · INTELLIGENCE — shared Kebu Account; separate schemas; API boundaries.

## Rules

- Mobile-first · PWA · low bandwidth · eventual WhatsApp/SMS/USSD  
- One Kebu Account — diaspora uses same identity  
- End-to-end slices only · repair broken deps first · never hide errors  
- **Forbidden:** fake verification · fake scores · digital-only payments pretense · launching all 17 layers at once

Moat = **verification + transaction + reputation + fraud data** — not UI.
